    </div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="last-updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>

<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy explains how Better Credit Guide collects, uses, discloses, and protects information when you visit our website, purchase our educational digital guide, contact support, or use our website features.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
<p><strong>Contact Information:</strong> When you purchase the guide or contact support, we may collect your name, email address, and other information you choose to provide.</p>

<p><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Payments are processed by Stripe. We do not store full credit card numbers on our servers. Stripe may collect and process payment details according to its own privacy and security practices.</p>

<p><strong>Order and Download Information:</strong> We may collect order references, purchase records, download links, download activity, and related transaction information to deliver the product, provide support, prevent fraud, and maintain records.</p>

<p><strong>Support Communications:</strong> If you contact us, we may collect the contents of your message and related contact details so we can respond.</p>

<h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
<p>We may collect basic usage data such as pages visited, browser type, device information, referring URLs, approximate location, and site activity. We may use cookies or similar technologies for website functionality, analytics, security, and fraud prevention.</p>

<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
<p>We may use collected information to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Process purchases and deliver the digital guide;</li>
  <li>Send purchase confirmations, receipts, download links, and support responses;</li>
  <li>Provide customer support and resolve technical access issues;</li>
  <li>Maintain order, tax, accounting, fraud-prevention, and legal compliance records;</li>
  <li>Improve the website, product, and customer experience;</li>
  <li>Monitor site security and prevent misuse.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Information Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited information with service providers that help us operate the website, process payments, deliver digital products, provide analytics, prevent fraud, or comply with legal obligations.</p>

<p>Payment processing is handled by Stripe. We do not control Stripe’s separate privacy practices, and customers should review Stripe’s policies for details about payment data processing.</p>

<h2>Educational Product Disclaimer</h2>
<p>Better Credit Guide is an educational digital product. We are not a credit repair company, law firm, financial advisor, lender, or credit bureau. We do not guarantee credit score increases, credit report changes, removals, approvals, financing, or any specific outcome.</p>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain personal information only as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described in this policy, including product delivery, customer support, fraud prevention, tax/accounting records, and legal compliance.</p>

<h2>Your Rights</h2>
<p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or limit the use of certain personal information. Some records may need to be retained for legal, accounting, fraud prevention, or legitimate business purposes.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use essential cookies for website functionality and may use analytics cookies to understand website usage. You can control cookies through your browser settings, although some features may not work properly if cookies are disabled.</p>

<h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
<p>Our website and digital products are not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or policies of third-party websites.</p>

<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised “Last updated” date.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or need support, please contact our support team through the website support page.</p>

